WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:11.771
Vinnie and Mandy stared at the scary creature.

2
00:00:11.772 --> 00:00:16.785
"This is Master Masamune's private room," snapped Haruki.

3
00:00:16.786 --> 00:00:20.512
"What is that?" Vinnie pointed.

4
00:00:20.513 --> 00:00:23.836
"It's his armor," said Haruki.

5
00:00:23.837 --> 00:00:28.765
The helmet was made of iron, and it had a scary mask.

6
00:00:28.766 --> 00:00:32.228
A big curved moon was on top.

7
00:00:32.229 --> 00:00:36.934
"Do samurai wear that all the time?" asked Vinnie.

8
00:00:36.935 --> 00:00:42.341
"Samurai only wear their armor during battle," explained Haruki.

9
00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:45.564
"But we always carry our swords."

10
00:00:45.565 --> 00:00:48.367
Haruki showed the children his sword.

11
00:00:48.368 --> 00:00:53.312
"Now follow me," he said, walking away quickly.

12
00:00:53.313 --> 00:00:57.940
"Please go slower," Mandy cried.

13
00:00:57.941 --> 00:01:01.212
"I can only take small steps."

14
00:01:01.213 --> 00:01:03.964
Haruki slowed down.

15
00:01:03.965 --> 00:01:08.296
His kimono was not tight around the legs like Mandy's.

16
00:01:08.297 --> 00:01:13.460
"Why is my kimono so tight?" Mandy asked.

17
00:01:13.461 --> 00:01:19.850
"The kimono trains women not to step too fast or too far," explained Haruki.

18
00:01:19.851 --> 00:01:23.476
Haruki slid open a door to a room.

19
00:01:23.477 --> 00:01:25.720
"Stay here until I return,"

20
00:01:25.721 --> 00:01:28.522
he said, closing the door.

21
00:01:28.523 --> 00:01:32.568
Mandy admired a hanging scroll on the wall.

22
00:01:32.569 --> 00:01:35.935
Vinnie played with the sliding door.

23
00:01:35.936 --> 00:01:39.266
"I wish we had doors like this at home,"

24
00:01:39.267 --> 00:01:42.599
he remarked, opening the door wide.

25
00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:47.089
Outside, three men walked by in silence.

26
00:01:47.090 --> 00:01:52.508
They walked to another house and crawled through a small door.

27
00:01:52.509 --> 00:01:57.728
"I'll bet they're samurai too!" said Vinnie, excited.

28
00:01:57.729 --> 00:02:02.964
"Let's see what's going on."

29
00:02:02.965 --> 00:02:06.079
"Bowing to enter is a sign of respect,"

30
00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:11.175
said one samurai, as the children crawled through the door too.

31
00:02:11.176 --> 00:02:16.673
In the room, the samurai were sitting very still on straw mats.

32
00:02:16.674 --> 00:02:21.849
There was a space beside one of the samurai close to the door.

33
00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:26.060
"Let's sit there," whispered Vinnie, pointing.

34
00:02:26.061 --> 00:02:31.634
A man greeted everyone, and the samurai bowed to the floor.

35
00:02:31.635 --> 00:02:37.889
Then the man took a cloth and began slowly wiping a small teacup.

36
00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:43.936
"It looks like he's going to serve tea," said Mandy.

37
00:02:43.937 --> 00:02:51.057
"It sure takes a long time," said Vinnie, yawning.

38
00:02:51.058 --> 00:02:55.031
The man cleaned each teacup and spoon.

39
00:02:55.032 --> 00:03:00.066
Next he opened a small bowl and took some tea from it.

40
00:03:00.067 --> 00:03:02.929
Then he put the tea into a cup.

41
00:03:02.930 --> 00:03:06.575
His movements were graceful and slow.

42
00:03:06.576 --> 00:03:10.925
"My legs hurt," complained Vinnie.

43
00:03:10.926 --> 00:03:16.657
He stretched his leg and accidentally kicked the samurai next to him.

44
00:03:16.658 --> 00:03:19.946
The samurai did not even notice.

45
00:03:19.947 --> 00:03:24.873
The man serving the tea now poured water into the cup.

46
00:03:24.874 --> 00:03:27.834
Then he quickly stirred the tea.

47
00:03:27.835 --> 00:03:31.164
Vinnie began to massage his legs.

48
00:03:31.165 --> 00:03:35.361
Another samurai gave Vinnie a stern look.

49
00:03:35.362 --> 00:03:40.490
"Be still, Vinnie," whispered Mandy.

50
00:03:40.491 --> 00:03:44.187
"Let's get out of here," said Vinnie.

51
00:03:44.188 --> 00:03:49.918
He quietly slid the small door open and Mandy crawled out.

52
00:03:49.919 --> 00:03:55.324
When it was Vinnie's turn, his kimono got stuck in the door.

53
00:03:55.325 --> 00:03:58.257
"Help!" he cried.

54
00:03:58.258 --> 00:04:01.906
Everyone in the room turned and stared.

55
00:04:01.907 --> 00:04:12.357
Smiling nervously, Mandy pulled her brother free and slid the door shut.
